post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
razerctl installed a udev rule (/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/70-razerctl.rules) so it can reach the mouse without root.
The rule only applies to a mouse that is plugged in after the rule is loaded, so either:
  - unplug and replug the mouse (the fallback that always works), or
  - run: sudo udevadm control --reload && sudo udevadm trigger
Then open razerctl from the app menu, or run razerctl-gui.
MSG
}
